gpq(){return'If you already have, or have fine-tuned, a compatible .onnx model elsewhere, you can import it via "Settings \u2192 Custom ONNX model import & test" \u2014 you\'ll need to provide the model file, its matching tokenizer configuration (or choose "none"), and the AI class index. Before importing, the app automatically checks whether this exact file was already imported, to avoid accidental duplicates. You can also adjust engine weights and the 20%\u201390% AI flagging threshold from Settings.'},
